# The typed CI tools audit these semantic inputs at source level, and several
# readers deliberately reject noncanonical line endings. Keep this list
# coordinated with `tools/zc/src/ci.rs` and its representative attribute test
# so Git for Windows cannot rewrite a valid checkout into different input.
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.tsv  text eol=lf
